    "detailed_description": "Gentle Club is a fighting simulator inspired by Hollywood movies, distinguished by the choreographed stunts the players perform while fighting in dynamic and destructible environments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers will be able to interact with the environment (use a broken bottle to slice the opponent, break the window of an airplane and depressurize the cabin, throw any kind of objects on the opponent). <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the end of the fight, the players would have the opportunity to see the scene again in the form of an action scene.",
